Subject: [PATCH 7/8] docs: add a "Working in the monorepo" section to each
 tool's and recipes' README

Where development happens now (the old repository is a read-only mirror of the folder), and how to clone, set up and test the tool in the monorepo: the symlinked recipes/ and examples/ folders, the per-tool Python versions, the commit hooks (prek) and where releases are made. recipes: deploying from the monorepo folder. The commands are checked word for word in a fresh clone by migration/verify.sh.
